msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລະບົບກູ້ໄພ:"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:548
msgid "Additional files to be copied into the rescue system:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະຖືກຄັດລອກເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບກູ້ໄພ:"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:551
msgid "Removal of malformed post recovery scripts:"
msgstr "ການລຶບສະຄຣິບຫຼັງການກູ້ຄືນທີ່ຜິດຮູບແບບ:"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:554
msgid "Additional post recovery scripts:"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຫຼັງການກູ້ຄືນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:558
msgid "YaST would like to change your ReaR configuration."
msgstr "YaST ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງການກຳນົດຄ່າ ReaR ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:561
msgid "You might end up in an unusable backup if you don't accept this."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຍອມຮັບສິ່ງນີ້."

#. prepare advanced menu
#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:585
