msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ Rear ດຽວນີ້"

#. set settings according to options read from config file.
#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:701
msgid "BACKUP is set to an unknown value.\n"
msgstr "BACKUP ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ.\n"

#. choose selected option or fallback to "ISO" if nothing is set
#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:714
msgid "OUTPUT is set to an unknown value.\n"
msgstr "OUTPUT ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ.\n"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:731
msgid "NETFS_URL is set to an unknown value or in wrong format.\n"
msgstr "NETFS_URL ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ ຫຼື ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:740
msgid ""
"Your rear configuration file contains options this YaST2 module cannot "
"configure.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Rear ຂອງທ່ານມີຕົວເລືອກທີ່ໂມດູນ YaST2 ນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້.\n"

#: src/include/rear/ui.rb:745
msgid "Do you want to continue and overwrite these settings?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສືບຕໍ່ ແລະ ຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່?"

